{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"c192378df9052173869084c0bd7126bdad54ea4a1f41b040d7b1c0ea8a3ea988","ja":"TV収録の休憩中……","zh":"电视录制的中途休息中……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8fe0cb0a5196f3cc5f72376796ed8b627e3c7b442afd0b51b8632568251bc7ec","ja":"ふむふむ。タカネとのミーティング中にそんなことが\nあったんですね。教えてくれてサンクスです！","zh":"原来如此。在和贵音开会时发生了\n这种事啊。谢谢你告诉我！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"100545aa711989687e5e7ee9f66a89c1bfe91964078b69f49cfdf1164c2e951b","ja":"「いえいえ。お役に立てて何よりです。\nそれでは私はこれで」","zh":"「哪里哪里。能帮上忙就再好不过了。\n那我先告辞了」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c8c78014796f0282d34018dca1afe39b1de3d29aa2e946d037f05fca80c441ca","ja":"あら、コロちゃん。何かありましたの？","zh":"哎呀，可乐。有什么事吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0c1fea741b4c5af3c2940b8032b911435fa3853f25f6389656e547e14f19a40e","ja":"ロコの提案で、ドラマPR用の\nニュースペーパーを作ることになったんです。","zh":"因为ROCO的提议，\n决定制作电视剧宣传用的报纸了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1274ca629c4c87568103b8e8d8c7b51c90acc07297844fc2d0f97f68fe62df62","ja":"それで、ドラマのスタッフさんに、\nインタビューをさせてもらってました。","zh":"所以，我接受了电视剧工作人员的采访。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9768d2c5b59ea7b48f827f7a5d92bfa5b8b1c349f622001615270dcf93dee530","ja":"あと、コロじゃなくてロコです～！","zh":"还有，不是可乐，是ROCO啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2cb0fee57be5dcc2b814f75c559ac0fcc1017ed1b09c4f4d530084a030984d13","ja":"ああ、●●●●プロデューサーが\n次はどんなPRをするか、悩んでましたわね。","zh":"啊，●●●●制作人\n之前还在为下次该做什么宣传而烦恼呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"5bb61e3e4a7a03fda2cd742e745646b36cda13cf2121380a6ba7716a742ce268","ja":"ドラマの役柄にピッタリで、\n素晴らしい試みですわ！","zh":"与剧中的角色非常契合，\n真是一次绝妙的尝试呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"dd476ee8f976b48cda16870ed08192cdd15cfd4d63d58762fb6396cd5be37636","ja":"えへへ♪　ということでロコは、アーティスティックで\nインパクトのある記事を目指して頑張ります！","zh":"欸嘿嘿♪　因此ROCO会努力写出\n富有艺术感又具冲击力的报道！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e73ac381d783084bd7bc68ed103e78c06030e0f70f3866dbed965f1b47f56899","ja":"こうしてロコは、新聞のネタを入手しようと、\n他のメンバーをこっそり調べることにしたのだけど……","zh":"就这样，ROCO为了搜集报纸的新闻素材，\n决定悄悄调查其他成员，可是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"487c564a6b4e47160f1722960f1314a279bbd9f12840f68b30309714673dc956","ja":"！？　はて、なにやら面妖な気配が……。","zh":"！？　咦，总觉得有一股奇特的气息……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"51476a596ab2a6c71a6692480f32747c22b45d98f47b347865abc56063c37270","ja":"（むむ、大スクープの予感がします～♪）","zh":"（唔唔，有大独家新闻的预感～♪）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"e6d0a8af22dc10ece8d3f180ab95cf63e97716b9aaa02b97c1715f1810b9944b","ja":"ふふ、番組げすとのあるぱかでしたか。\n本日はよろしくお願いいたします。","zh":"呵呵，原来是节目的羊驼嘉宾啊。\n今天请多关照。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"b6b959370192475fb5006069177ab092d22b7ef74c18e1afe3d7c7a66df5c5e8","ja":"アルパカに気づいただけ……。\nキュートですけど、スクープには……。","zh":"只是注意到了羊驼而已……。\n虽然很可爱，但称不上是独家新闻……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"6ff42ce2c6b99e4f52c0ef72d711ed330d62bd4a04a4856d9dff79197d22b787","ja":"「クンクン……」\nもしゃ……。","zh":"“闻闻……”\n吧唧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"b442012aa86948f7e68b532d3601e2f7e32eee6097f2d48258ecf6f3e0b5b12b","ja":"わぁっ！","zh":"哇啊！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"f183ebb7044670504a3b0fc3a1e18ab58b00cdf817ec590f8a47f7febaa575c9","ja":"おや、みちこ？　どうしました？","zh":"哎呀，美智子？怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1714.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"80d12c293ef39c3947945206bd2b5b152d9d436e75b17ae00d2443cedc98c5da","ja":"アルパカが、ロコの髪を食べようとして……。\nあと、ロコはみちこじゃなくて、ロコです～！","zh":"羊驼想要吃ROCO的头发……\n还有，ROCO不是路子，是ROCO啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
